Third-party licenses
====================

This file covers third-party material distributed as part of this repository.

Scope note: this file exists because this repository VENDORS third-party source
code (see "1. Vendored source" below). Declared dependencies are fetched from
public package indexes at install time and are not redistributed here; their
licenses are summarised in section 2 for convenience only.

Every figure in section 2 was read from a lockfile or from installed package
metadata, never inferred from a package's reputation. Each subsection names the
command that reproduces it.


